lore_blurb = "The UNEXPLAINED case files. Witness testimony from 94 military personnel across 17 countries. Radar track data from installations in Alaska, Germany, and Okinawa showing objects performing maneuvers beyond any known propulsion system.\n\nThe original sketches — made by witnesses attempting to describe object geometry — were attached to this volume when it was received at Warehouse 51. They are no longer attached. The paperclip marks are still there.\n\nSomeone pulled the sketches before cataloging. Access logs show the file was checked out twice in 1989. Both entries list the same employee ID. That employee has no personnel record."
